# A microservice image builds from the repository root, so Turborepo can prune
# the workspace; only what the services need enters the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
!apps/microservices
!packages/streaming
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/Dockerfile
